  "timeline": [
    {
      "id": "narration-01",
      "at": 0.15,
      "type": "audio.play",
      "channel": "narration",
      "text": "冬夜很静，松林像一排沉睡的巨人。小兔皮普抱紧围巾，沿着雪地里忽明忽暗的微光，慢慢向前走。",
      "lang": "zh-CN",
      "rate": 1.03,
      "pitch": 1.04
    },
    {
      "id": "snow-begins",
      "label": "微光照进松林",
      "at": 0.4,
      "type": "effect.start",
      "effect": "snow",
      "params": { "density": 0.22 }
    },
    {
      "id": "rabbit-first-steps",
      "at": 0.6,
      "type": "move",
      "target": "rabbit",
      "to": { "x": 300, "y": 638 },
      "duration": 12,
      "ease": "power1.inOut"
    },
    {
      "at": 3,
      "type": "camera.zoom",
      "to": 1.025,
      "duration": 10,
      "ease": "sine.inOut"
    },
    {
      "id": "narration-02",
      "at": 15.1,
      "type": "audio.play",
      "channel": "narration",
      "text": "风把旧脚印一点点盖住，皮普有些害怕。每当它停下，前方的光就轻轻闪一下，像在说：别担心，我在这里。",
      "lang": "zh-CN",
      "rate": 1.03,
      "pitch": 1.04
    },
    {
      "id": "rabbit-through-snow",
      "label": "风雪盖住脚印",
      "at": 15.3,
      "type": "move",
      "target": "rabbit",
      "to": { "x": 510, "y": 638 },
      "duration": 12,
      "ease": "power1.inOut"
    },
    {
      "at": 17,
      "type": "camera.pan",
      "to": { "x": 615, "y": 360 },
      "duration": 10,
      "ease": "sine.inOut"
    },
    {
      "id": "narration-03",
      "at": 30.1,
      "type": "audio.play",
      "channel": "narration",
      "text": "穿过最后一排松树，它看见一间小木屋。窗边亮着蜂蜜色的灯，门前还留着一串新鲜的小脚印。",
      "lang": "zh-CN",
      "rate": 1.03,
      "pitch": 1.04
    },
    {
      "id": "cottage-light",
      "label": "木屋亮起暖光",
      "at": 30.2,
      "type": "fade",
      "target": "doorGlow",
      "to": 0.36,
      "duration": 7,
      "ease": "sine.inOut"
    },
    {
      "at": 31,
      "type": "move",
      "target": "rabbit",
      "to": { "x": 700, "y": 638 },
      "duration": 10,
      "ease": "power1.inOut"
    },
    {
      "at": 33,
      "type": "camera.zoom",
      "to": 1.055,
      "duration": 9,
      "ease": "sine.inOut"
    },
    {
      "id": "narration-04",
      "at": 45.1,
      "type": "audio.play",
      "channel": "narration",
      "text": "皮普刚刚走近，木门便吱呀一声打开。暖光铺在雪上，屋里传来声音：快进来吧，我们一直在等你。",
      "lang": "zh-CN",
      "rate": 1.03,
      "pitch": 1.04
    },
    {
      "id": "door-opens",
      "label": "木门缓缓打开",
      "at": 45.2,
      "type": "rotate",
      "target": "door",
      "to": -72,
      "duration": 3,
      "ease": "power2.inOut"
    },
    {
      "at": 45.2,
      "type": "fade",
      "target": "doorGlow",
      "to": 0.92,
      "duration": 3,
      "ease": "sine.inOut"
    },
    {
      "at": 47.5,
      "type": "effect.stop",
      "effect": "snow"
    },
    {
      "at": 48,
      "type": "effect.start",
      "effect": "snow",
      "params": { "density": 0.55 }
    },
    {
      "at": 50,
      "type": "expression",
      "target": "rabbit",
      "value": "happy"
    },
    {
      "id": "narration-05",
      "at": 60.1,
      "type": "audio.play",
      "channel": "narration",
      "text": "门后不是陌生人，而是走散许久的松鼠朋友。桌上有热汤、松果面包，还有一盏专门为皮普留着的小灯。",
      "lang": "zh-CN",
      "rate": 1.03,
      "pitch": 1.04
    },
    {
      "at": 60.3,
      "type": "move",
      "target": "rabbit",
      "to": { "x": 790, "y": 638 },
      "duration": 8,
      "ease": "power1.inOut"
    },
    {
      "id": "friends-reunite",
      "label": "朋友终于重逢",
      "at": 62,
      "type": "camera.zoom",
      "to": 1.12,
      "duration": 10,
      "ease": "sine.inOut"
    },
    {
      "at": 62,
      "type": "camera.pan",
      "to": { "x": 590, "y": 350 },
      "duration": 10,
      "ease": "sine.inOut"
    },
    {
      "id": "narration-06",
      "at": 75.1,
      "type": "audio.play",
      "channel": "narration",
      "text": "朋友说，暴风雪来临前，它们每天都把灯挂在窗边，希望迷路的皮普，能够认出回家的方向。",
      "lang": "zh-CN",
      "rate": 1.03,
      "pitch": 1.04
    },
    {
      "id": "light-kept-burning",
      "label": "窗边的灯一直亮着",
      "at": 75.2,
      "type": "scale",
      "target": "rabbit",
      "to": 0.94,
      "duration": 3,
      "ease": "sine.inOut"
    },
    {
      "at": 78.2,
      "type": "scale",
      "target": "rabbit",
      "to": 0.86,
      "duration": 4,
      "ease": "sine.inOut"
    },
    {
      "at": 82,
      "type": "move",
      "target": "rabbit",
      "to": { "y": 625 },
      "duration": 2,
      "ease": "sine.inOut"
    },
    {
      "at": 84,
      "type": "move",
      "target": "rabbit",
      "to": { "y": 638 },
      "duration": 2,
      "ease": "sine.inOut"
    },
    {
      "at": 85,
      "type": "effect.stop",
      "effect": "snow"
    },
    {
      "at": 85.2,
      "type": "effect.start",
      "effect": "snow",
      "params": { "density": 0.32 }
    },
    {
      "id": "narration-07",
      "at": 90.1,
      "type": "audio.play",
      "channel": "narration",
      "text": "窗外的雪越下越轻，屋里的笑声却越来越暖。皮普终于明白，真正照亮森林的，从来不只是一盏灯。",
      "lang": "zh-CN",
      "rate": 1.03,
      "pitch": 1.04
    },
    {
      "id": "light-in-the-heart",
      "label": "真正的光在心里",
      "at": 90.2,
      "type": "camera.zoom",
      "to": 1.04,
      "duration": 12,
      "ease": "sine.inOut"
    },
    {
      "at": 90.2,
      "type": "camera.pan",
      "to": { "x": 640, "y": 360 },
      "duration": 12,
      "ease": "sine.inOut"
    },
    {
      "at": 92,
      "type": "rotate",
      "target": "door",
      "to": -42,
      "duration": 4,
      "ease": "power2.inOut"
    },
    {
      "at": 94,
      "type": "fade",
      "target": "doorGlow",
      "to": 0.68,
      "duration": 8,
      "ease": "sine.inOut"
    },
    {
      "at": 96,
      "type": "rotate",
      "target": "door",
      "to": -72,
      "duration": 4,
      "ease": "power2.inOut"
    },
    {
      "id": "narration-08",
      "at": 105.1,
      "type": "audio.play",
      "channel": "narration",
      "text": "那一夜，松林深处多了一扇永远为朋友打开的门。无论风雪多大，只要记得彼此，回家的路就不会消失。",
      "lang": "zh-CN",
      "rate": 1.03,
      "pitch": 1.04
    },
    {
      "id": "open-door-ending",
      "label": "一扇永远打开的门",
      "at": 105.2,
      "type": "fade",
      "target": "doorGlow",
